@startuml chaos-control
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #94a3b8
skinparam componentBorderColor #7c3aed

title Harness 混沌工程控制平面架构

rectangle "控制平面 (Harness SaaS)" as control {
    component "实验设计器 (可视化)" as designer
    component "混沌中心 (Chaos Hub)" as hub
    component "韧性评分引擎" as scoring
    component "RBAC + Chaos Guard\n爆炸半径控制" as guard
}

rectangle "可观测性集成" as observability {
    component "Resilience Probes (健康检查探针)" as probes
    component "Prometheus/Datadog/New Relic 集成" as monitoring
    component "应用映射 (服务依赖图)" as app_map
}

designer --> hub : 选择实验模板
guard --> designer : 策略约束
probes --> scoring : 上报健康状态
monitoring --> scoring : 上报指标
scoring --> designer : 韧性分数反馈

note right of guard
  Chaos Guard 功能：
  • 禁止在生产高峰期执行
  • 限制特定命名空间
  • 限制最大故障范围
  • 只读环境保护
end note

@enduml
